# Web frontend

- New games: lazy-load in `App.tsx`, `ErrorBoundary`, `GameShell`, route under `/games/`.
- Game modules live in `apps/web/src/games/<name>/`.
- Use shared components: `BuddyBot`, `TTSButton`, `Feedback`, theme tokens from Tailwind config.
- TTS: use `playTts()` from `lib/ttsPlayer.ts` — do not fire parallel speak requests.
- Teachable Machine / webcam: browser-only; no upload of camera frames to API.
- Buttons min ~48px; avoid flashing animations; keyboard/aria labels on interactive controls.
- Student-facing strings in Vietnamese; keep sentences short.
